In support of his arguments, Ld. Counsel for the appellant has relied upon the reported judgments in cases of Hindustan Lever Ltd. Vs Food Inspector and another 2006(1) FAC 237 delivered by Hon'ble Supreme Court of India; Harish Chand vs State in Criminal Revision No.100 of 1970 decided on 14.05.1970 by Hon'ble Delhi High Court; Nutrine Confectionery Co. Ltd. vs State of Himachal Pradesh and Voltas Limited in Cr.M.P.(M) 145 of 1978 decided on 10.11.1978 by Hon'ble Himachal Pradesh High Court; Municipal Corporation of Delhi vs Nand Kishore in Criminal Revision No.158 of 1972 decided on 09.08.1972 by the Hon'ble Delhi High Court;
M/s Buttercup Confectionery Ltd & Ors. Vs FSO Page No. 6 of 17 State of Kerala vs K.S.Balakrishnan in Criminal Appeal No.187 of 1972 decided on 13.09.1972 by the Hon'ble Kerala High Court and M/S Buttercup Confectionary Ltd vs Food Safety Officer on 30 October, 2019 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/69080198/
